t$view </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> renderTable</span><span>({</span><span>\r\n  head</span><span>(</span><span>datasubset</span><span>(),</span><span> \r\n  n</span><span>=</span><span>nrow</span><span>(</span><span>datasubset</span><span>()))</span><span>\r\n</span><span>})</span></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<p><br></p><p>Doing so I get an error when running Shiny:</p>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><span>Error</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>Math</span><span>.</span><span>POSIXt</span><span>(</span><span>x </span><span>+</span><span> ifelse</span><span>(</span><span>x </span><span>==</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span>))</span><span> </span><span>:</span><span> \r\n      </span><span>&#39;abs&#39;</span><span> </span><span>not</span><span> </span><span>defined</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>&quot;POSIXt&quot;</span><span> objects</span></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<p><br></p><p>Does anyone know a solution for this error?</p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n    </font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
